1269+ 7776 07               rlca
1270+ 7777 07               rlca
1271+ 7778 07               rlca
1272+ 7779 07               rlca
1273+ 777A E6 03            and  3
1274+ 777C 12               ld   (de), a
1275+ 777D 13               inc  de
1276+ 777E
1277+ 777E                  ; Cella 2: bit 3-2
